{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1542968-the-curseborne-kickstarter-has-begun","id":1542968,"title":"The Curseborne Kickstarter Has Begun!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-01T11:39:00-07:00","id":1542968,"title":"The Curseborne Kickstarter Has Begun!","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/curseborne-tabletop-roleplaying-game/description\" target=\"_blank\">Like moths in a spider's web, it's time to tear the strands apart and chase the light.</a><br /> <br /> Talk about it here!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-01T16:06:12-07:00","id":1542984,"title":"","content":"Less than six hours and it already doubled the initial pledge.<br /> <br /> I'm sharing the page with my friends, I'll try to get the most reach among Bras\u00edlia's RPG community.<br /> <br /> Boa sorte!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-02T00:04:01-07:00","id":1542994,"title":"","content":"The $ goal has been tripled in the first day. The Kickstarter has been a wicked success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-08T22:53:41-07:00","id":1543397,"title":"","content":"So, in the first week, we've gotten $130,347 so far (34.31%* of the way to <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-werewolf-the-apocalypse-20th-anniversary-ed/description\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf the Apocalypse 20th Anniversary Edition's final amount</a> and 19.04% towards <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-exalted-3rd-edition/description\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition's Kickstarter</a>, if you want randomly chosen Onyx Path Kickstarters to compare against), with a total backer count currently of 1,832 (86.91% and 41.95%). This is a really good place to be from the first week!<br /> <br /> In terms of content out for people who might not have checked it out so far, we have the Introduction and Chapter 1, The Lineage Chapter Opening and the Family breakdown and Practice overviews** for Lineages of The Dead and the Hungry. In terms of Stretch Goals achieved, we so far have the Tangled Webs supplement unlocked, including more Liminalities, Shattered Spaces, and adversaries for people to use, The Curseborne Fiction Anthology with two unique stories diving into the world of the Accursed, and the Accursed Adventure Supplement, including premade characters, supporting cast, and a pre-made adventure to play.<br /> <br /> For anyone not familiar with the Kickstarter trains, the next two weeks are gonna look slower in terms of financial/backer count increases, but definitely keep your eyes on it and keep bringing people in. October 10th will see the full break down of the Outcasts, while October 15th will see the Primals come up next, and in terms of Stretch Goals, the next two to unlock are the Backer T-Shirt (to be sold on Redbubble) and two more stories for the Curseborne Fiction Anthology.<br /> <br /> Let's keep up the pace!<br /> <br /> *Rounded up to the second decimal point, erring on up, as all the other pecentages are.<br /> **The Chapter detailing the Practices of the Accursed's magic is coming later in the KS, but this still gives a good overall understanding of each Lineage's particular corner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-09T01:47:54-07:00","id":1543404,"title":"","content":"Yes indeed! Please tell your friends and gaming groups and post on whatever social mediums you prefer!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-09T18:31:25-07:00","id":1543474,"title":"","content":"Curseborne had me at the \u201cthe dead\u201d but loving \u201cthe outcasts\u201d I may need to spring for a deluxe copy now. And maybe the dice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-10T08:05:18-07:00","id":1543525,"title":"","content":"Not a surprise if you seen my activity on Discord (or that I have<a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/accursed-curseborne\" target=\"_blank\"> yet another new Tumblr moodboard</a>) but here goes.<br /> <br /> While I was intrigued by the Ashcan, I never got a chance to properly read it and now the Kickstarter has fully sold me on Curseborne. Defintely a lot of familiar elements, but with their own unique spins that gives Curseborne a nostalgic yet unique feel. It has just been straight up fun and refreshing to read an urban horror game that scratches an itch for me while everything is also brand new and doesn't have decades of lore already established. <br /> <br /> All hail the raccoons! <br /> <br /> (Seriously, whoever came up with the raccoon analogy, that was a brilliant bit of writing)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T09:51:49-07:00","id":1543996,"title":"","content":"All right, where we are this week-'pologies for not getting this last night, I ended up going to bed early <i>for once</i>.<br /> <br /> Anyways, we are now up to $148,160 (38.99% of Werewolf the Apocalypse 20th Anniversary Edition's final financial amount on the Kickstarter, 21.64% of Exalted 3rd Edition's Kickstarter) and a total backer count of 2,126 (beating out Werewolf's 2,108 total count and makes up a 48.68% of Exalted's). Pretty normal for the mid-Kickstarter slump.<br /> <br /> For those wanting to check on what's come out since then, well we got the overview of my current favorite Lineages, the Outcasts(2nd favorite) and the Primal(1st) and the quick overview of their Manifestation and Maelstrom Practices* respectively. The Stretch Goals got the Backer Shirt, the additional story for the Fiction Anthology(as opposed to the two I said last time, my bad), and the Digital Wallpapers unlocked, so goodies all around there.<br /> <br /> The next week will see the second and generally final part of the mid-Kickstarter slump. On the 17th**, we'll be getting the final Lineage writeup for the Sorcerers, and on the 21st we'll be getting the ruleset showing how Curseborne will use (and tweak) the Storypath Ultra ruleset, including Character Creation. The next Stretch Goals on the docket include a Story Seed chapter for the Tangled Webs supplement and Virtual Tabletop Tokens for people who play online games.<br /> <br /> Keep the raccoons coming!<br /> <br /> *The Dead's and Hungry's Signature Practices are Haunting and Predation, for the record.<br /> **Unrelated to Curseborne, Remedy Entertainment will also be announcing information regarding The Lake House DLC for Alan Wake 2, which is mostly just important to me, but if you're digging Curseborne, odds are you'll enjoy Remedy games as well, so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T17:20:07-07:00","id":1544036,"title":"","content":"Kinda wild how much more money Werewolf raised on fewer people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T19:18:36-07:00","id":1544059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nobody Special</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1542968-the-curseborne-kickstarter-has-begun?p=1544036#post1544036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kinda wild how much more money Werewolf raised on fewer people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Werewolf had a fan base with 30 years of nostalgia behind it, people will pay a premium for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T19:33:25-07:00","id":1544061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nobody Special</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1542968-the-curseborne-kickstarter-has-begun?p=1544036#post1544036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kinda wild how much more money Werewolf raised on fewer people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pre-established fanbase with 20 years of nostalgia during a relative economic upswing on a KS with the baseline for a physical booking starting at twice what Curseborne has it come in and a lot of more high-end purchase option. It'll happen.<br /> <br /> The big takeaway for the moment, though, is that it took a month for them to get that backer count. CB's done it in half the time. If it was 120 instead of 60 for a physical book....Well, just going at the baseline, you got 674 backer buying at the Hungry Tier where you first get the option for hardcover, where as you had 448 doing the same Garou tier (again, lot of people sprung for even higher) who were spending 120 for it. If CB was doing the same and people still bought in, we'd be looking at $80,880, against the $53,760 they actually got.<br /> <br /> Context matters!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-16-2024, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T20:57:12-07:00","id":1544066,"title":"","content":"Also, shipping would have counted in the Werewolf pledge numbers, but is now being applied separately in Backerkit. That is definitely going to change the numbers, even if it doesn\u2019t account for everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T05:57:05-07:00","id":1544090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1542968-the-curseborne-kickstarter-has-begun?p=1544061#post1544061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pre-established fanbase with 20 years of nostalgia during a relative economic upswing on a KS with the baseline for a physical booking starting at twice what Curseborne has it come in and a lot of more high-end purchase option. It'll happen.<br /> <br /> The big takeaway for the moment, though, is that it took a month for them to get that backer count. CB's done it in half the time. If it was 120 instead of 60 for a physical book....Well, just going at the baseline, you got 674 backer buying at the Hungry Tier where you first get the option for hardcover, where as you had 448 doing the same Garou tier (again, lot of people sprung for even higher) who were spending 120 for it. If CB was doing the same and people still bought in, we'd be looking at $80,880, against the $53,760 they actually got.<br /> <br /> Context matters!</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah I didn't mean that as shade on Curseborne just that the average CB backer had already spent a fair amount so the average WtA backer spending closer to four times that feels pretty wild to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-23T20:27:48-07:00","id":1544621,"title":"","content":"A day late, but let's get a look at where we are another week later.<br /> <br /> The Kickstarter is now up to $158,316(41.67% of W20, 23.13% of Exalted 3rd) and 2,313 backers(52.96% of Exalted 3rd, 205 ahead of W20). We're now entering the last week, so we're gonna see another surge as we begin to approach the end of the Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Not only did we get the last Lineage since last week with the Sorcerers, we now have the basic game rules, character creation rules, and the magic of the Accursed, so if you were waiting for the game to be basically be playable in it's fullness, you've got enough to really start playing it from the core. In terms of Stretch Goals, we got the Story Seed addition to the Tangled Webs Supplement and the VTT assets from last time.<br /> <br /> In terms of the remaining chapters, we have the Storyguiding Chapter coming in on Friday on the 25th and the Antagonist chapter finishing things up on the 29th, on the off chance you like to settle on your games based on the challenges you get. For Stretch Goals, the next three are another Adventure for the Accursed Adventure Supplement, a Streaming Overlay for online play of Curseborne, and another story for the Curseborne Fiction Anthology at the moment-but as the final surge comes on it, we can expect to see a lot more pop up as we go on.<br /> <br /> And finally, as I mentioned a few times, the Kickstarter officially ends come noon MST on October 13th, 2024. If you've been holding off on checking it out, even if you're gonna back out afterwards if it's not your cup of tea, this is the time.<br /> <br /> Let's put a damned good ending on this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}